# Variables for the files in this folder.
#
# VS Code REST Client: put these in .vscode/settings.json under "rest-client.environmentVariables".
# Visual Studio / JetBrains: use that tool's own http-client environment file.
#
#   orgUrl              https://yourorg.crm.dynamics.com
#   token               a Microsoft Entra ID access token for orgUrl
#   prefix              your publisher customization prefix, e.g. new
#   solutionUniqueName  the unmanaged solution to create components into
#   recordFilterId      the GUID returned by 02-create-recordfilter.http
#
# Get a token with the Azure CLI:
#   az account get-access-token --resource https://yourorg.crm.dynamics.com --query accessToken -o tsv
